  "chapter": 15,
  "sortOrder": 43015,
  "verseCount": 27,
  "aliases": [
    "John",
    "Jn",
    "Jhn"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "I am the true vine, and my Father is the husbandman.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Now ye are clean through the word which I have spoken unto you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch cannot bear fruit of itself, except it abide in the vine; no more can ye, except ye abide in me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "I am the vine, ye are the branches: He that abideth in me, and I in him, the same bringeth forth much fruit: for without me ye can do nothing.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "If a man abide not in me, he is cast forth as a branch, and is withered; and men gather them, and cast them into the fire, and they are burned.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "If ye abide in me, and my words abide in you, ye shall ask what ye will, and it shall be done unto you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Herein is my Father glorified, that ye bear much fruit; so shall ye be my disciples.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "As the Father hath loved me, so have I loved you: continue ye in my love.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "If ye keep my commandments, ye shall abide in my love; even as I have kept my Father’s commandments, and abide in his love.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, that my joy might remain in you, and that your joy might be full.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "This is my commandment, That ye love one another, as I have loved you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Greater love hath no man than this, that a man lay down his life for his friends.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Ye are my friends, if ye do whatsoever I command you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard of my Father I have made known unto you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and that your fruit should remain: that whatsoever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "These things I command you, that ye love one another.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "If the world hate you, ye know that it hated me before it hated you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "If ye were of the world, the world would love his own: but because ye are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world, therefore the world hateth you.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "Remember the word that I said unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord. If they have persecuted me, they will also persecute you; if they have kept my saying, they will keep yours also.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "But all these things will they do unto you for my name’s sake, because they know not him that sent me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "If I had not come and spoken unto them, they had not had sin: but now they have no cloak for their sin.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "He that hateth me hateth my Father also.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "If I had not done among them the works which none other man did, they had not had sin: but now have they both seen and hated both me and my Father.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "But this cometh to pass, that the word might be fulfilled that is written in their law, They hated me without a cause.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "But when the Comforter is come, whom I will send unto you from the Father, even the Spirit of truth, which proceedeth from the Father, he shall testify of me:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:john:15:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "And ye also shall bear witness, because ye have been with me from the beginning.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "John 15:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:john:15:27"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
